## Integration

| Route | Auth |
|-------|------|
| `/api/integration/hotel-lifecycle` | bridge secret — `enterRequestTenant(event.organizationId)` before Prisma; check-in/out, **guest departed/moved**, room change, stay product changed. Checkout closes OPEN episodes, cancels SCHEDULED/CHECKED_IN, and releases the resource booking. `POST /api/cron/episode-hotel-checkout` repairs a missed event when the hotel stay is already CHECKED_OUT. `GET /api/internal/v1/stay-procedures` is the checkout list for a medical hotel |
| `/api/integration/staff-provision` | bridge secret — `enterRequestTenant`; scrypt User hash; Practitioner unique name link |
| `/api/integration/settlement-confirmed` | bridge secret — hotel Front Cash paid callback; `organizationId` required, `enterRequestTenant` before Prisma |
| `/api/billing/context` | session — `deferWalkInToHub` for cashier gate |
| `/api/procedures/confirm` | session **DOCTOR** (+ admin) — confirm `PROPOSED` → `placeConfirmedProcedures` FIFO. Placement loads rules, duty and occupancy once and searches the stay in memory. Returns seated `orderIds` plus miss rows (`ymd`, reason). Unplaced stay `PROPOSED`; 409 only when none seated. Package assign keeps sessions that seated and drops only the new rows that did not; the toast names the procedure and the day. Sollyuks is one code (`SVC-SOLLYUKS`); the package twin `SVC-SOLYUKS` is removed. |
| `/api/procedures/bulk-cancel` | session **RECEPTION** (+ admin) — bulk cancel + optional replace code |
| `GET /api/procedures/[id]` | session `API_PROCEDURES_READ` — matrix order card (patient, room, staff, package vs paid, quota index) |
| `PATCH /api/procedures/[id]` | session **DOCTOR** / **RECEPTION** (+ admin) — PROPOSED/SCHEDULED: `siteIds[]`, `siteApplyMode` (TURN/TOGETHER), `note`, legacy `bodyPart` (derived from sites when `siteIds` sent) |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/reschedule` | session **RECEPTION** (+ admin) — that minute or 409 (`evaluateCandidateSlot`, no `nextWorkSlot` snap). Plan card sends `allowOtherDay` (block cap, bath rest, weekly naftalan, checkout day until 12:00; 409 `PAST_CHECKOUT` / `CHECKOUT_NOON` / `BATH_REST` / `WEEK_FULL` / `DAY_FULL` / `CLOSED`). Resource matrix omits the flag, so another day is 409 `CROSS_DAY` |
| `POST /api/procedures` | session **RECEPTION** — paid same-day extra: `PROPOSED` + `placeConfirmed` with `pinStrict`; closed day 409 `CLOSED` |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/cancel` | session **RECEPTION** |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/check-in` | session NURSE — QR / MANUAL (`checkInRequiresQr=false`) / override; channel-aware window; **atomic → `CHECKED_IN`** (no auto-complete) |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/start` | alias of check-in |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/complete` | session NURSE — stuck `CHECKED_IN` fallback only (happy path = auto by `endsAt`). A department clinic queues consumables to the hotel journal; a standalone clinic keeps the finance procedure event |
| `/api/nurse/qr-scan` | session NURSE — verifyGuestQrToken; returns `qrToken` for check-in |
| `/api/cron/procedure-auto-complete` | Bearer `PLATFORM_CRON_SECRET` — `CHECKED_IN` past `endsAt` → `COMPLETED`; Wave 4 `byOrganization` |
| Procedure TTK → Finance (CLI-47) | **API** — `ProcedureConsumableLine`; `GET/PUT …/procedure-types/[id]/consumables`; `GET /api/admin/finance-products?isService=false` for components. Sellable SKU on `ProcedureType` and `DiagnosticService` searches `GET /api/admin/catalog?q=` and opens on the existing catalog code when `financeSku` is empty |
| `/api/cron/procedure-no-show-sweep` | Bearer `PLATFORM_CRON_SECRET` — stale `SCHEDULED` → `NO_SHOW` (burns quota), then after `dayEndHour` unpaid `PENDING_PAY` extras → `UNPAID_MISSED`: today seated + overdue `scheduledAt` + unseated created before today (no folio, cabin freed); Wave 4 `byOrganization` |
| `/api/cron/episode-walkin-close` | Bearer `PLATFORM_CRON_SECRET` — idle `WALK_IN`+`OPEN` → `CLOSED` (CLI-55; refuses live procedures/labs); path→module `clinic_inpatient` |
| `GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE /api/patients/[id]/complaints` | session — course complaints (`?episode=`); CLOSED read-only |
| `POST /api/sanatorium/episodes/[id]?action=close` | session RECEPTION/DOCTOR — close idle walk-in course |
| `GET /api/patients/[id]/episodes` | session — all care courses for card selector (CLI-55) |
| `PATCH /api/sanatorium/episodes/[id]` | session — OPEN episode anamnesis |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/no-show` | session NURSE — burns quota + may charge folio |
| `/api/sanatorium/resources/available-slots` | session RECEPTION — free inventory (exhausted omitted) |
| `/api/capacity/summary` | public + `serviceApiPrefixes` in middleware; bridge secret — GET remaining%/risk for the caller's `x-era-organization-id` (400 without it; hotel proxy sends its session org); POST `runCronForEachTenant` (orch pool registry) → `byOrganization` |

